  "implementedInSource": [
    "Use the actual issued HTTPS/x402/DP/V6 seed and selected-grant service, not a smaller SQLite substitute",
    "Preserve the original fixed two-unit debit, leaving eight of ten available units",
    "Retain and acknowledge funding checkpoint, signed bytes, hash and independent pins before funding submission",
    "Retain and acknowledge the exact service original and proof before dispatch",
    "Stop at the actual completeDurableExecution COMMIT after the native transaction returned and before its response",
    "Use separate bounded read-only native SQLite handles instead of forbidden same-store callback reentry",
    "Hold the seed main thread for at most 5000 ms without creating a Worker; fail if the selected signal is not observed",
    "Wait for the exact seed SIGKILL, complete stdout/stderr EOF and IPC disconnect before distinct recovery",
    "Recover the same principal files through the actual no-dispatch V6 backend recovery client",
    "Retain checkpoint, original request, dispatch intent and zero response observations; do not dispatch or sign again",
    "Require unchanged backend envelope, payer metadata except owner_epoch, and a single owner_epoch increment",
    "Retain persisted UNKNOWN and cached CHILD_UNKNOWN even if one payer SQLite close returned",
    "Require child boot/namespace admission before sending initial IPC input",
    "Keep all baseline app/package rows mandatory before effectful child imports and reject undeclared resolution"
  ],
